    <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="section" dg:origin="1 240 1228 2310 1951">
      <dg:chunk dg:structure="header" dg:origin="1 240 1228 1026 1271" dg:style="font-weight: bold; color: darkslateblue">
        <dg:chunk dg:structure="lim" dg:origin="1 240 1228 277 1271">1.</dg:chunk> Financial and Operational Narrative</dg:chunk>
      <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1327 2310 1367; 1 240 1386 2310 1426; 1 240 1446 2310 1485; 1 240 1505 1615 1545">During the third quarter of 2146, the Belet Dunes facility operated in compliance with all covenants and technical metrics detailed in the Secured Credit Agreement (Document 6A). The photovoltaic collector arrays maintained high molecular stability, posting a quarterly average Solar Conversion Efficiency Index (SCEI) of <docset:CurrentPeriodValue xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="93.1" dg:origin="1 2060 1446 2183 1485" xml:id="currentperiodvalue" dg:itemprop="exceeds" dg:href="#covenantthreshold">93.1%</docset:CurrentPeriodValue>, which comfortably exceeds the <docset:CovenantThreshold xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="89.0" dg:origin="1 680 1505 793 1545" xml:id="covenantthreshold">89.0%</docset:CovenantThreshold> baseline standard specified in Section 4.01(1).</docset:OperationalNarrative>
      <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1615 2310 1654; 1 240 1674 2310 1713; 1 240 1733 2310 1773; 1 240 1793 2310 1832; 1 240 1852 2310 1892; 1 240 1911 753 1951">Energy delivery volumes averaged <docset:AnnualCommodityYield dg:origin="1 879 1615 1435 1654" xml:id="annualcommodityyield" dg:itemprop="exceeds" dg:href="#covenantthreshold-2">21,450 Megawatt-hours (MWh)</docset:AnnualCommodityYield> equivalent per Titan sidereal cycle, meeting the Solar Power Tariff Target of <docset:CovenantThreshold dg:origin="1 800 1674 1031 1713" xml:id="covenantthreshold-2">20,000 MWh</docset:CovenantThreshold> outlined in Section 4.01(2). Consequently, the Facility Loans accrued interest at the baseline interest rate of <docset:InterestRate dg:origin="1 920 1733 1473 1773" dg:style="font-weight: bold">TIDOR plus 6.75% per annum</docset:InterestRate>, with no triggers of the Dynamic Siphon Charge Premium. In addition, our escrow balances in the Helium-Pressurized Sinking Fund and the Regolith Stabilisation Escrow were fully maintained at <docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve dg:origin="1 850 1852 1142 1892">SC 200,000,000</docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve> and SC 400,000,000 respectively, satisfying all requirements of Sections 4.01(3) and 4.01(4).</docset:OperationalNarrative>
    </docset:OperationalNarrative>
